  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Copenhagen Gl\u00f8d Index Close No. Section 01 Home 02 Menus 03 Events 04 Private dining 05 Story No. Section 06 Journal 07 Gift cards 08 Visit 09 Book a table 10 All pages Find us J\u00e6gersborggade 41, 2200 K\u00f8benhavn N Open Wednesday to Saturday, 17:30 to 23:00 Talk to us [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 wine dinner Harvest dinner Six courses over the fire, with growers from the Loire. Book a seat Book a seat Read more Read more When Thursday 8 October, 19:00 Price 1150 kr with wine Seats 28 in total Kind Wine dinner The evening The harvest is in, and two of our favourite growers from the Loire are taking the train up to Copenhagen with their new wines still cloudy in the bottle. We cook six courses over the fire around what they pour: the last tomatoes from Stevns, plaice from Gilleleje, grilled mushrooms from the beech woods, and a tarte of apples baked in the embers. How it works One seating at 19:00 for the whole room. The price includes every course and a glass with each, poured and explained by the people who made them. Tell us about allergies when you book. 1150 kr with wine. Tell us about allergies when you book. Book a seat Book a seat Also coming up All events ",
